{
 "esm": "2.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "StaticArrayOperators",
  "description": "State-free scalar gathers of shape transformations, positional broadcast, and region assembly. Reshaping back to a vector preserves column-major order. The later makearray region wins at an overlap and the gap is zero.",
